# Implementation Plan — Razorpay Payment Gateway: Complete Business, Cost & Technical Guide

A comprehensive, production-ready guide and implementation plan for integrating Razorpay into the Rudroham E-Commerce store.

---

## 1. Razorpay Pricing & Fee Structure (How Razorpay Charges)

> [!TIP]
> **Zero Upfront & Zero Annual Fees**
> Razorpay charges **NO setup fee** and **NO monthly or annual maintenance charge (AMC)**. You only pay a small percentage when a customer actually buys an item. If you make zero sales in a month, you pay **₹0**.

### Fee Breakdown

| Payment Method | Razorpay Fee | GST on Fee | Real Example on ₹1,000 T-Shirt Sale |
|---|---|---|---|
| **UPI** (GPay, PhonePe, Paytm, BHIM) | **~0% to 2%** | 18% on fee | Fee: ₹0 to ₹20 → You receive: **₹980 – ₹1,000** |
| **RuPay Debit Cards** | **0%** (Govt mandate) | ₹0 | Fee: ₹0 → You receive: **₹1,000 (100%)** |
| **Visa / Mastercard (Domestic)** | **2.0%** | 18% on fee (₹3.60) | Total fee: ₹23.60 → You receive: **₹976.40** |
| **Net Banking** (50+ banks) | **2.0%** | 18% on fee (₹3.60) | Total fee: ₹23.60 → You receive: **₹976.40** |
| **Cash on Delivery (COD)** | **0%** (built into project) | ₹0 | **₹0 fee** to Razorpay (settled by courier) |

### How Settlement Works
* When a customer pays ₹1,000 via Razorpay, Razorpay automatically deposits **₹976.40 to ₹1,000** directly into your linked Indian Bank Account on a **T+2 settlement cycle** (within 2 business days).

### How to Minimize Fees (Pay the Lowest Possible Amount)
1. **Encourage UPI & RuPay**: UPI and RuPay have the lowest gateway charges. Razorpay defaults to UPI on mobile for Indian customers.
2. **Offer Cash on Delivery (COD)**: Your project already has COD implemented. COD incurs ₹0 payment gateway fee.
3. **Standard Plan (No Add-ons)**: Stick to Razorpay's **Standard Plan** (free). Do not subscribe to optional paid add-ons like *Razorpay Magic Checkout* or *Thirdwatch* until your sales volume exceeds ₹10 Lakhs/month.

