## 2. Step-by-Step Guide: How to Get Real (Live) Keys

### Step 1: Create Account
1. Go to [razorpay.com](https://razorpay.com) and sign up with your email.
2. Select your business type: **Individual** (if you don't have a registered company yet) or **Sole Proprietorship / Pvt Ltd**.

### Step 2: Complete KYC (Instant to 24-48 Hours)
Upload standard verification details:
- **Identity**: PAN Card + Aadhaar Card of the business owner.
- **Bank Account**: Account number + IFSC (upload a cancelled cheque or bank statement so Razorpay knows where to send your payouts).
- **Business Details**: "Clothing / Retail / Streetwear Brand".

### Step 3: Website Compliance Check (Mandatory by RBI & Razorpay)
Before activating live keys, Razorpay will inspect your website. Your website **must have**:
- [x] Functional product catalog & working checkout.
- [x] Working Contact Us information (support email + phone number).
- [x] Standard E-Commerce policy pages in the footer:
  - Privacy Policy
  - Terms & Conditions
  - Shipping & Delivery Policy
  - Return & Refund Policy (already supported by our return module)

### Step 4: Generate Live API Keys
1. In your Razorpay Dashboard, toggle the mode from **Test Mode** (orange) to **Live Mode** (green).
2. Go to: **Account & Settings** → **Website and App Settings** → **API Keys**.
3. Click **"Generate Live Key"**.
4. You will see:
   - **`Key ID`**: `rzp_live_xxxxxxxxxxxxxx`
   - **`Key Secret`**: `xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx`
5. Copy both into your live backend environment (Render).

